<title>USA: PLR buys Texas assets.</title>
<headline>PLR buys Texas assets.</headline>
<dateline>BIRCHTREE, Mo 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLR Inc said it had bought 1,337 acres of natural gas producing properties in Webb County, Texas with potential gas reserves of 120 billion cubic feet from Cordele Development Corp.</p>
<p>The reserve estimate comes Wilford Lee Stapp, a consultant retained by Cordele and PLR said the reserves could be worth $240 million using a natgas price of $2.00 per thousand cubic feet.</p>
<p>The reserves are located in the Wilcox Trend and PLR said it would have a ten well drilling program in place &quot;as soon as possible&quot;. ((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
